Credits and third-party assets for "The Invisible Jacket"

Picture: drawn in code with the Crayon Picture Book engine from Lemo-Opuscar (https://github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar), styles/crayon-book/demo (library code, MIT; library content, CC BY 4.0).
Fonts:
- Gaegu (Regular, Bold): SIL Open Font License 1.1, Copyright 2018 The Gaegu Project Authors. Via @fontsource/gaegu 5.3.0.
- Patrick Hand (Regular): SIL Open Font License 1.1. Via @fontsource/patrick-hand 5.3.0.
Narration voice: Kokoro (af_heart), offline text-to-speech, Apache-2.0 model.
Music: original composition, synthesised with the library's pluck (music box, kalimba) and harp presets. No samples.
Foley: procedural sound effects from the library's sfx helpers (synthesised).
Video encoding: ffmpeg 7.0.2 static build (LGPL/GPL) from the imageio-ffmpeg package.
